<<tag character:Narrator>>
<<tag lore_id:lore_resetscout_badge>>
Narrator: A brass badge lies half-sunk in the silt at the lip of the mud pool, hammered out of shape by something heavier than a boot.
Narrator: The crest is still legible: a hollow eye inside a broken wheel. Bureau of Continuance.
Narrator: The pin is bent. Dried blood — not mud — flecks the rim.
Narrator: Someone fought here recently, and someone lost. The badge's owner left no body, only this.
Narrator: A scrap of paper clings to the back, stamped: "Subject Lirael — quarantine pending. Hour 17 priority."
===
